{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Fixed in commit 451212e377a with teenage-unquieted-ringworm's next-batch rebuild: blocker statuses now come from every ticket's reduced state, with error/fsck_needed and missing tickets counted as finished, matching ready. Tests: test_non_terminal_blocker_outside_the_active_set_still_blocks[blocked|idea] fail on the old code and pass on the new; test_closed_blocker_releases_its_dependent passes on both. On a clone of the live store, all 11 open epics give identical output, so no live ticket is currently affected."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793292655934124001,"uuid":"02ce4bef-6fe5-4f35-90c5-ef75f43c35e9"}